message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "ShallowFrontier: Energy-Efficient LLM Data Selection via Asymmetric Prefix Extrapolation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Seungho
    affiliation: "Hankuk University of Foreign Studies"
  - family-names: Yang
    given-names: Suchan
    affiliation: "Hankuk University of Foreign Studies"
abstract: >-
  ShallowFrontier selects 10% of an instruction-tuning pool for full fine-tuning with one shallow calibration run.
  It groups the pool from the prompts alone, measures each group's gradient noise scale, and selects differently
  in each learning phase, without domain labels or reference answers.
keywords:
  - large language models
  - data selection
  - instruction tuning
  - energy efficiency
  - green AI
